@startuml aws-architecture
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"

title AWS Architecture (Prod/Stg)

rectangle "Internet" as net

rectangle "AWS Account (prod or stg)\nVPC" as vpc {
  rectangle "Public Subnets" as pub {
    [ALB\n(HTTPS Termination)] as alb
  }

  rectangle "Private Subnets" as priv {
    rectangle "ECS Cluster (Fargate)" as ecs {
      [Frontend\nNuxt SSR (Node)] as fe
      [BFF\nSpring Boot (Kotlin)] as bff
      [Backend\nSpring Boot (Kotlin)] as be
      [Batch Task\nSpring Batch\n(Scheduled)] as batch
    }

    database "RDS PostgreSQL" as rds
  }

  [Secrets Manager] as secrets
  [SSM Parameter Store] as ssm
  [CloudWatch Logs/Metrics] as cw
  [EventBridge Scheduler] as ev
  [ECR] as ecr
}

net --> alb : HTTPS
alb --> fe : HTTP (internal)\n/ (SSR) or static proxy
alb --> bff : HTTP (internal)\n/api
fe --> bff : internal API calls\n(optional if SSR)
bff --> be : REST/GraphQL
be --> rds : SQL 5432
batch --> rds : SQL 5432

ev --> batch : run task on schedule

fe ..> secrets : read secrets (task role)
bff ..> secrets
be ..> secrets
batch ..> secrets

fe ..> ssm
bff ..> ssm
be ..> ssm
batch ..> ssm

fe ..> cw : logs/metrics
bff ..> cw
be ..> cw
batch ..> cw

ecr ..> ecs : image pull

note right of fe
SSRが不要なら:
Frontendは S3 + CloudFront に移行し
ECSの常時稼働を減らすと運用/コストが改善
end note

@enduml